I first check for connection leaks—unclosed connections or missing finally blocks.

Then I analyze pool usage, long-running queries, and slow transactions holding connections.

I optimize queries, add indexes, and tune pool size appropriately.

One edge case is traffic spikes combined with slow queries causing saturation.

So overall, I fix leaks, optimize queries, and tune the pool.”


Follow-ups

